  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "听说了，Snake。Amanda好像把你错认成格瓦拉了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 62,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "怎么样，心里其实还挺受用的吧？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 45,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "饶了我吧。我根本连格瓦拉的脚后跟都够不上。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 63,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_IDIOM_EXPANSION_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "还真谦虚。在我看来，你也已经是个相当了不起的人了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 75,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_ADDS_YOUR_MEN_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "对方可是「20世纪最完美的人」啊？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 47,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "萨特吗？　不过，格瓦拉已经彻底成了那个时代的<R=象征,イコン>。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=象征,イコン>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 89,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED;SOURCE_IDEOGRAPHIC_SPACE_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "更重要的是，他是个真诚的革命家，也是伟大的战士。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_TRUE_VS_SINCERE_CORRECTED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "这点我同意。毕竟他和卡斯特罗一起渡海去古巴后，身边据说只剩12名伙伴。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 101,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "但他们从那里扳回了局面。他们召集同伴、扩大组织，并赢得了农民的支持。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 102,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_REFERENCE_CLIPPED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "最后，他们推翻了巴蒂斯塔政权……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 48,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "人们因他的真诚而聚集，又因他的强大而取得胜利。那是伟大的资质。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 93,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_GREAT_QUALITIES"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "不过，我们现在所处的状况也差不多。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 51,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "就凭我们这么点人，却要向一支背后有美国撑腰的军队发起挑战。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 87,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_ADDS_MERCENARY_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 13,
      "cn_text": "离格瓦拉还远得很。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 27,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_GENERALIZES_REFERENCE_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 14,
      "cn_text": "但也只能继续走下去。除了赢得战斗，也要留意招揽人手、扩大<R=组织,MSF>。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=组织,MSF>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 101,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 15,
